<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/0c1ed7367b1da64ae1ee4df38d2b1de3dde17d77f27515184a2154e727f1a5d0> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
