<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/0db5acb8a06fbe1a4aeed1cfa5b6a6f2690ca86f88c6cfeb27a0d2babada31e7> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
