<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/246619df5cee856afd730f160369e29e6a76c288923e71357b2afb80ae90c317> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
