<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/5d06c2fa6eef170d9e4f6d36e0b96aafcdeb6b439889154a2e64bd49999a4443> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
