<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/61b301ef2f70284ef63f5e9f055fad96af294f65cb2ac37959ee58104bf81f61> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
