<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/625eae4227b389dc07eb5615cd2180815a4117e024d1e70da172e85dab74ae4f> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
