<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/64c3ffd1336fc75bdf9927eb26ed50a619578793a8a48353c529601de00fe8d9> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
