<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/70e361d4e4160ab0c4f307e89602c455a5b6692e6948f1077862734dfe79733d> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
