<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/7905389372f34b51b45dc5608fefea6c782253204d0b79e087cde0cfbdd34481> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
