<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/91b499f41d98fa8c273abf92704c177f6309a891882a53b5abfb5b7717ebdacb> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
