<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/945614514eab7e447bef0567fd65b6b2805929105c96338bab1aab6b422662e0> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
