<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/9d6357aca706cb75671d6e830d4935876de997b1fc7a64c6f41b89a24cb8cc5a> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
