<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/b2469e731fff264a0f6118bdaa783e226554f29619b1a3ae1087a43e008b47d4> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
