<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/c99019a84e12dce9fcb1d9a2e06b1259ebe08057f9bafe433ef5cb96450af9a3> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
