<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/ca3bc86efda57e0690f0ec11827f95cf036b2b98efe2116141b4f277c7bf029d> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
