<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/d8684749c53956f88b3f13f442a8d348892e1403c675668a1c542cf02c982f73> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
