<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/e08a1d8327c88cdff71ac86fb5a4ab080cc67c2d4f8f6a0d87c1436a3cb6cf79> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
