<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/e909e60eba5999388de54bd7e484d33b781c99129fefed795d3a3301c3f1a13a> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
