<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/eb76aced6f5551b727842d34bcd361ec5fb007f5da73b76ad6bd2f0a75dde7b1> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
