<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/ec0099a9f3fc0547d6ea485f4495666b59eca0de10ea346e444894a143248874> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
