<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/fa95067c627d792b9bacc777ff40b1d64faba2deea0b923f1325a02e9d241049> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
